            "description": {
              "value": "A vortex of sand and dust surrounds you. Each creature inside your kinetic aura (including you) is concealed from any creature outside your kinetic aura, and creatures outside the aura are concealed from creatures inside the aura other than you.\n\nYour air impulses carry sands that cut at great speed. When you use a damaging air impulse that affects at least one creature in your kinetic aura, that impulse deals 1 additional slashing damage, or 2 if the impulse has a single target."
